  "conclusion": "Offline stale knowledge is nonzero: a withdrawn import remains readable until retraction arrives. A valid lease bounds strict stale-action exposure to its remaining lifetime, but strict actions become unavailable after expiry even when the origin is still current. Reconnection can deliver a withdrawn lease and quarantine the import. These results are contract-level, not a claim of zero stale reads, physical partition behavior, or field availability.",
